== damage formula ==
attack * skill * affinity * crit * K / (K + defence),  K = 300, floor 1
crit is 1250 on a critical strike and 1000 otherwise, so an ordinary hit is untouched
multipliers are parts per thousand, base 1000

== defence curve, share of damage getting through ==
defence  per mille
      0       1000
    100        750
    200        600
    300        500
    400        428
    500        375
    600        333
    700        300
    800        272
    900        250
   1000        230
   1100        214
   1200        200

